    "@value": "1787-08"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/constitutional-convention/timeline/9",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Thirty-eight delegates sign thirty-nine names to the finished Constitution; three present delegates refuse.",
