   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/declaration-of-independence/timeline/3",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "A first vote on Lee's resolution: nine colonies in favour, Pennsylvania and South Carolina opposed, Delaware deadlocked and New York abstaining.",
