    "@value": "1945-01-02"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/japanese-american-incarceration/timeline/11",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Tule Lake closes, the last of the ten WRA camps; the WRA is disbanded on June 30, 1946.",
