    "@value": "1796"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/judicial-review/timeline/3",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "In Marbury v. Madison the Court, through Chief Justice John Marshall, holds part of the Judiciary Act of 1789 unconstitutional.",
