    "@value": "1863-07-04"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/mississippi-river/timeline/6",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "During the Great Flood of 1927, engineers begin dynamiting the levee at Caernarvon, Louisiana, below New Orleans.",
