    "@value": "1937"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/new-deal/timeline/11",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Spending cuts help bring on a sharp recession beginning in the fall; industrial production falls by a third.",
