    "@value": "1662-12"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/slavery-in-the-united-states/timeline/3",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "A Virginia law classes enslaved people as real estate.",
