    "@value": "1866-07-23"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/supreme-court-of-the-united-states/timeline/11",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Congress fixes the Court at nine justices, where it has remained.",
