    "@value": "1842"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/underground-railroad/timeline/5",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Henry \"Box\" Brown is shipped in a crate by rail from Richmond to Philadelphia, a 27-hour journey.",
