    "@value": "1851-09-11"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/underground-railroad/timeline/8",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Anthony Burns escapes from Richmond; he is arrested in Boston and returned to slavery under the 1850 law.",
