   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/voting-rights-act-of-1965/timeline/12",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Congress renews the special provisions for 25 more years in the Fannie Lou Hamer, Rosa Parks, Coretta Scott King, Cesar E. Chavez, Barbara Jordan, William Velazquez and Dr. Hector Garcia reauthorization act.",
