    "@value": "2006"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/voting-rights-act-of-1965/timeline/13",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "In Shelby County v. Holder the Supreme Court, 5 to 4, holds the Section 4(b) coverage formula unconstitutional, halting preclearance.",
