    "@value": "1814-08-09"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812/timeline/13",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "After the Battle of Bladensburg, British troops occupy Washington and burn the Capitol and the President's house.",
   "uso:date": {
